# Fault: disable simulated GPS (GPS1)
# Effect: SIM_GPS1_ENABLE = 0 stops the SITL GPS driver from sending
#         GPS data to the autopilot. The EKF loses the position fix,
#         variance rises above FS_EKF_THRESH (0.8), and after
#         EKF_CHECK_ITERATIONS_MAX (10) consecutive bad checks at 10 Hz
#         (= ~1 s), the EKF failsafe fires.
#
# Parameter: SIM_GPS1_ENABLE
# Declared: libraries/SITL/SIM_GPS.cpp:42
#   AP_GROUPINFO_FLAGS("ENABLE", 1, GPSParms, enabled, 0, AP_PARAM_FLAG_ENABLE)
# Full param name in SITL: SIM_GPS1_ENABLE (SIM group + GPS1_ subgroup + ENABLE field)
# Verified in Tools/autotest/arducopter.py (multiple set_parameter calls)
#
# MAVProxy usage:
#   param load course/labs/intro-arducopter-aero-y1/l3-closing-lab/faults/inject_gps_off.parm
# Or directly:
#   param set SIM_GPS1_ENABLE 0
SIM_GPS1_ENABLE 0
